// DevPilot AI — Diagramme de composants  (Eraser diagram-as-code)
title DevPilot AI — Composants et dépendances

colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean
direction down

Frontend [icon: nextjs, color: blue, label: "Frontend Next.js"]
API [icon: python, color: blue, label: "API FastAPI"]
Workflow [icon: cpu, color: purple, label: "Pipeline agentique"]
Celery [icon: refresh-cw, color: orange, label: "Celery worker"]
Redis [icon: redis, color: orange]
Postgres [icon: postgresql, color: green]
Qdrant [icon: database, color: green]
Ollama [icon: server, color: teal]
Gemini [icon: google, color: teal]
Observability [icon: activity, color: red, label: "Prometheus / Grafana"]

Frontend > API
API > Workflow
API > Postgres
API > Redis
Redis > Celery
Workflow > Qdrant
Workflow > Ollama
Workflow > Gemini
Celery > Postgres
Celery > Qdrant
API > Observability
